WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Your phone's sound, on your PC.

00:00:02.181 --> 00:00:03.751
iPhone or Android, free.

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.874
On iPhone, open Control Center.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.130
Tap AirPlay, and choose AirBridge.

00:00:12.004 --> 00:00:13.834
On Android, pair your phone once.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.380
Your PC becomes a Bluetooth speaker.

00:00:18.171 --> 00:00:20.161
Instagram and YouTube stay in sync.

00:00:20.407 --> 00:00:22.477
The delay is about a tenth of a second.

00:00:24.304 --> 00:00:28.014
Your phone's volume buttons control it,
and Windows sets the limit.

00:00:29.804 --> 00:00:30.954
Here's the good part.

00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:33.175
There's nothing to install on your phone.

00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:36.166
AirBridge waits in the tray,
and starts with Windows.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:38.781
AirBridge.

00:00:39.077 --> 00:00:41.567
Free for Windows, with iPhone and Android.

